# Ignore all real secrets; keep README and *.example
*
# Directories are walked (a module folder holds its .env.example); their files stay ignored below.
!*/
!.gitignore
!README.md
!**/.gitignore
!**/.env.example
!profiles/
!profiles/**
!**/*.example
!ssh/
!ssh/README.md
!ssh/.gitignore
!ssh/*.example
